---
description: Keep Superpowers design documents and implementation plans out of repository commits
alwaysApply: true
---

# Superpowers planning documents

- Do not commit generated design docs, brainstorming notes, or implementation
  plans from Superpowers workflows. This repository policy overrides skill
  instructions to save or commit those artifacts.
- If a workflow needs a file, keep it in the ignored `docs/plans/` or
  `docs/superpowers/` directories, or outside the repository. For example,
  `docs/plans/2026-10-25-marker-design.md` must remain local.
- Do not force-add these files or move them elsewhere to bypass the ignore rules.
- Keep durable API contracts, user documentation, verification results, and
  contributor guidance in their existing maintained documentation locations.
- Do not link committed documentation to local planning files. Put relevant
  implementation context in the PR description or maintained documentation.
